{"lesson": {"id": "completer_carre_sommet", "title": "Compléter le carré et lire le sommet", "language": "fr", "learning_goal": "Transformer x² + 6x − 7 en (x + 3)² − 16 et lire le sommet S(−3 ; −16) sur la parabole."}, "math_context": {"symbols": {}, "expressions": {"f_de_moins3": "(0)^2 - 16"}}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s_carres", "introduces": [{"id": "f1", "type": "math", "content": "f(x) = x^2 + 6x - 7", "parts": [{"id": "p_x2", "text": "x^2"}, {"id": "p_6x", "text": "+ 6x"}, {"id": "p_m7", "text": "- 7"}]}, {"id": "carre_x", "type": "polygon", "params": {"vertices": [[0, 0], [2, 0], [2, 2], [0, 2]]}}, {"id": "lab_x2", "type": "label", "content": "x^2", "attachment": {"parent": "carre_x", "anchor": "center"}}, {"id": "bande_6", "type": "polygon", "params": {"vertices": [[2, 0], [8, 0], [8, 2], [2, 2]]}}, {"id": "lab_6x", "type": "label", "content": "6x", "attachment": {"parent": "bande_6", "anchor": "center"}}, {"id": "bande_3a", "type": "polygon", "params": {"vertices": [[2, 0], [5, 0], [5, 2], [2, 2]]}}, {"id": "lab_3xa", "type": "label", "content": "3x", "attachment": {"parent": "bande_3a", "anchor": "center"}}, {"id": "bande_3b", "type": "polygon", "params": {"vertices": [[5, 0], [8, 0], [8, 2], [5, 2]]}}, {"id": "lab_3xb", "type": "label", "content": "3x", "attachment": {"parent": "bande_3b", "anchor": "center"}}, {"id": "carre_coin", "type": "polygon", "params": {"vertices": [[2, -3], [5, -3], [5, 0], [2, 0]]}}, {"id": "lab_coin", "type": "label", "content": "3 \\times 3 = 9", "attachment": {"parent": "carre_coin", "anchor": "center"}}, {"id": "note_moitie", "type": "text", "content": "moitié de 6 = 3", "layout": {"to_corner": "top_right", "gap": "md"}}], "beats": [{"id": "b1_1", "say": "On part de x carré plus six x moins sept. Regarde bien les deux premiers termes, x carré plus six x : c'est eux qu'on va compléter.", "cues": [{"id": "c_part", "text": "On part"}, {"id": "c_regarde", "text": "Regarde bien"}, {"id": "c_completer", "text": "compléter"}], "do": [{"id": "w_f1", "verb": "write", "target": "f1", "at": "cue:c_part"}, {"id": "h_f1", "verb": "highlight", "target": "f1", "role": "accent", "start": "cue:c_regarde", "end": "cue_end:c_completer"}]}, {"id": "b1_2", "say": "x carré, c'est un carré de côté x. Six x, c'est une bande de longueur six collée à droite du carré.", "cues": [{"id": "c_xcarre", "text": "x carré"}, {"id": "c_cote", "text": "côté x", "occurrence": 1}, {"id": "c_bande", "text": "bande de longueur six"}], "do": [{"id": "d_carre", "verb": "draw", "target": "carre_x", "at": "cue:c_xcarre"}, {"id": "s_lab_x2", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_x2", "at": "cue:c_cote"}, {"id": "d_bande", "verb": "draw", "target": "bande_6", "at": "cue:c_bande"}, {"id": "s_lab_6x", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_6x", "at": "after:d_bande"}]}, {"id": "b1_3", "say": "Pour compléter, je coupe la bande six x en deux bandes de trois x, et j'en mets une sous le carré.", "cues": [{"id": "c_coupe", "text": "je coupe"}, {"id": "c_troisx", "text": "deux bandes de trois x"}, {"id": "c_sous", "text": "sous le carré"}], "do": [{"id": "d_3a", "verb": "draw", "target": "bande_3a", "at": "cue:c_coupe"}, {"id": "d_3b", "verb": "draw", "target": "bande_3b", "at": "cue:c_troisx"}, {"id": "s_lab_3xa", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_3xa", "at": "after:d_3a"}, {"id": "s_lab_3xb", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_3xb", "at": "after:d_3b"}, {"id": "mv_3b", "verb": "move", "target": "bande_3b", "to": {"align_to": "carre_x", "align": "bottom"}, "at": "cue:c_sous"}]}, {"id": "b1_4", "say": "Il reste un trou dans le coin : trois par trois, ça fait neuf. Ce neuf, c'est le carré de la moitié du six.", "cues": [{"id": "c_trou", "text": "trou dans le coin"}, {"id": "c_neuf", "text": "ça fait neuf"}, {"id": "c_moitie", "text": "carré de la moitié du six"}], "do": [{"id": "d_coin", "verb": "draw", "target": "carre_coin", "at": "cue:c_trou"}, {"id": "s_lab_coin", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_coin", "at": "cue:c_neuf"}, {"id": "s_note", "verb": "show", "target": "note_moitie", "at": "cue:c_moitie"}, {"id": "h_lab_coin", "verb": "highlight", "target": "lab_coin", "role": "result", "start": "cue:c_moitie", "end": "cue_end:c_moitie"}], "pause_after": "long"}]}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s_completer", "introduces": [{"id": "f2", "type": "math", "content": "x^2 + 6x + 9 - 9 - 7", "parts": [{"id": "q_x2", "text": "x^2"}, {"id": "q_6x", "text": "+ 6x"}, {"id": "q_9a", "text": "+ 9"}, {"id": "q_9b", "text": "- 9"}, {"id": "q_7", "text": "- 7"}]}, {"id": "f3", "type": "math", "content": "f(x) = (x + 3)^2 - 9 - 7", "parts": [{"id": "r_carre", "text": "(x + 3)^2"}, {"id": "r_9", "text": "- 9"}, {"id": "r_7", "text": "- 7"}]}, {"id": "encadre", "type": "math", "content": "x^2 + 6x + 9 = (x + 3)^2", "layout": {"next_to": "f3", "direction": "right", "gap": "lg"}}, {"id": "f4", "type": "math", "content": "(x + 3)^2 - 16", "parts": [{"id": "t_carre", "text": "(x + 3)^2"}, {"id": "t_16", "text": "- 16"}], "style": {"role": "result"}}], "beats": [{"id": "b2_1", "say": "On a donc x carré plus six x, plus neuf, moins neuf, moins sept. On ajoute neuf et on l'enlève tout de suite : rien ne change.", "cues": [{"id": "c_donc", "text": "On a donc"}, {"id": "c_ajoute", "text": "On ajoute neuf"}, {"id": "c_enleve", "text": "on l'enlève"}, {"id": "c_rien", "text": "rien ne change"}], "do": [{"id": "f_carres", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "carre_x", "at": "cue:c_donc"}, {"id": "f_coin", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "carre_coin", "at": "cue:c_donc"}, {"id": "t_1", "verb": "transform", "source": "f1", "target": "f2", "at": "cue:c_donc"}, {"id": "w_9a", "verb": "write", "target": "f2", "part": "q_9a", "at": "cue:c_ajoute"}, {"id": "w_9b", "verb": "write", "target": "f2", "part": "q_9b", "at": "cue:c_enleve"}, {"id": "h_rien", "verb": "highlight", "target": "f2", "role": "accent", "start": "cue:c_rien", "end": "cue_end:c_rien"}]}, {"id": "b2_2", "say": "Les trois premiers termes forment le carré de x plus trois, parce que x plus trois au carré donne x carré plus six x plus neuf.", "cues": [{"id": "c_trois", "text": "trois premiers termes"}, {"id": "c_carre3", "text": "carré de x plus trois"}, {"id": "c_donne", "text": "x plus trois au carré donne"}], "do": [{"id": "s_encadre", "verb": "show", "target": "encadre", "at": "cue:c_carre3"}, {"id": "t_2", "verb": "transform", "source": "f2", "target": "f3", "at": "cue:c_donne"}]}, {"id": "b2_3", "say": "Moins neuf moins sept, ça fait moins seize. Voilà la forme canonique : f de x égale x plus trois au carré, moins seize.", "cues": [{"id": "c_fait", "text": "ça fait moins seize"}, {"id": "c_canonique", "text": "forme canonique"}, {"id": "c_final", "text": "x plus trois au carré, moins seize"}], "do": [{"id": "t_3", "verb": "transform", "source": "f3", "target": "f4", "at": "cue:c_fait"}, {"id": "h_final", "verb": "highlight", "target": "f4", "role": "result", "start": "cue:c_final", "end": "cue_end:c_final"}], "pause_after": "normal"}]}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s_canonique", "introduces": [{"id": "fgen", "type": "math", "content": "f(x) = a(x - h)^2 + k", "parts": [{"id": "g_a", "text": "a"}, {"id": "g_h", "text": "h"}, {"id": "g_k", "text": "k"}], "layout": {"next_to": "f4", "direction": "down", "gap": "lg"}}, {"id": "fleche_signes", "type": "arrow", "params": {"from": [0, 0], "to": [0, 0]}}], "beats": [{"id": "b3_1", "say": "Dans le programme, la forme canonique s'écrit a fois x moins h au carré, plus k. Chez nous, a vaut un, h vaut moins trois et k vaut moins seize.", "cues": [{"id": "c_programme", "text": "Dans le programme"}, {"id": "c_forme", "text": "a fois x moins h au carré, plus k"}, {"id": "c_chez", "text": "Chez nous"}], "do": [{"id": "s_fgen", "verb": "show", "target": "fgen", "at": "cue:c_programme"}, {"id": "h_carre", "verb": "highlight", "target": "f4", "role": "accent", "part": "t_carre", "start": "cue:c_chez", "end": "cue_end:c_chez"}]}, {"id": "b3_2", "say": "Attention au signe : x moins h, donc x moins moins trois, ça fait x plus trois. C'est pour ça que h égale moins trois.", "cues": [{"id": "c_attention", "text": "Attention au signe"}, {"id": "c_moinsmoins", "text": "x moins moins trois"}, {"id": "c_hmoins3", "text": "h égale moins trois"}], "do": [{"id": "h_g_h", "verb": "highlight", "target": "fgen", "role": "accent", "part": "g_h", "start": "cue:c_attention", "end": "cue_end:c_attention"}, {"id": "h_f4_h", "verb": "highlight", "target": "f4", "role": "accent", "part": "t_carre", "start": "cue:c_hmoins3", "end": "cue_end:c_hmoins3"}, {"id": "h_f4_k", "verb": "highlight", "target": "f4", "role": "accent", "part": "t_16", "at": "after:h_f4_h"}]}]}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s_sommet", "introduces": [{"id": "rep", "type": "axes", "params": {"x": [-6, 3], "y": [-18, 4]}}, {"id": "parabole", "type": "function_graph", "params": {"expression": "(x + 3)^2 - 16", "domain": [-6, 2]}}, {"id": "axe", "type": "line", "params": {"from": [-3, -18], "to": [-3, 4]}}, {"id": "ptS", "type": "point", "params": {"at": [-3, -16]}, "style": {"role": "result"}}, {"id": "lab_S", "type": "label", "content": "S(-3 ; -16)", "attachment": {"parent": "ptS", "anchor": "right"}}, {"id": "verif", "type": "math", "content": "f(-3) = (0)^2 - 16 = -16", "layout": {"next_to": "lab_S", "direction": "right", "gap": "md"}}], "beats": [{"id": "b4_1", "say": "La forme canonique, c'est la parabole de base x carré décalée de moins trois en x et de moins seize en y.", "cues": [{"id": "c_parabole", "text": "parabole de base"}, {"id": "c_decalee", "text": "décalée de moins trois en x"}], "do": [{"id": "s_rep", "verb": "show", "target": "rep", "at": "beat:start"}, {"id": "d_parabole", "verb": "draw", "target": "parabole", "start": "cue:c_parabole", "end": "cue_end:c_decalee"}, {"id": "d_axe", "verb": "draw", "target": "axe", "at": "cue:c_decalee"}, {"id": "h_h", "verb": "highlight", "target": "f4", "role": "accent", "part": "t_carre", "start": "cue:c_decalee", "end": "cue_end:c_decalee"}]}, {"id": "b4_2", "say": "Cette droite verticale, x égale moins trois, est l'axe de symétrie. Le sommet est posé dessus, exactement à k égale moins seize.", "cues": [{"id": "c_droite", "text": "Cette droite verticale"}, {"id": "c_symetrie", "text": "axe de symétrie"}, {"id": "c_sommet", "text": "Le sommet"}, {"id": "c_k", "text": "k égale moins seize"}], "do": [{"id": "h_axe", "verb": "highlight", "target": "axe", "role": "accent", "start": "cue:c_droite", "end": "cue_end:c_symetrie"}, {"id": "h_k", "verb": "highlight", "target": "f4", "role": "accent", "part": "t_16", "start": "cue:c_k", "end": "cue_end:c_k"}, {"id": "s_S", "verb": "show", "target": "ptS", "at": "cue:c_sommet"}, {"id": "s_labS", "verb": "show", "target": "lab_S", "at": "after:s_S"}]}, {"id": "b4_3", "say": "Le sommet, c'est S moins trois, moins seize. Vérifions : f de moins trois égale zéro au carré moins seize, donc moins seize. C'est cohérent.", "cues": [{"id": "c_S", "text": "S moins trois, moins seize"}, {"id": "c_verif", "text": "Vérifions"}, {"id": "c_coherent", "text": "C'est cohérent"}], "do": [{"id": "h_S", "verb": "highlight", "target": "lab_S", "role": "result", "start": "cue:c_S", "end": "cue_end:c_S"}, {"id": "w_verif", "verb": "write", "target": "verif", "at": "cue:c_verif"}, {"id": "h_verif", "verb": "highlight", "target": "verif", "role": "result", "start": "cue:c_coherent", "end": "cue_end:c_coherent"}], "pause_after": "long"}]}}
{"slice": {"slice_id": "s_recap", "introduces": [{"id": "idee", "type": "text", "content": "Compléter le carré : ajouter et retirer le carré de la moitié du coefficient de x", "layout": {"next_to": "f4", "direction": "down", "gap": "md"}}], "groups": [{"id": "recap", "items": ["f4", "idee"], "arrange": {"direction": "down", "align": "left"}}], "beats": [{"id": "b5_1", "say": "Pour compléter le carré de x carré plus six x moins sept, on ajoute et on retire neuf : le carré de la moitié du six.", "cues": [{"id": "c_pour", "text": "Pour compléter le carré"}, {"id": "c_ajoute", "text": "on ajoute et on retire neuf"}, {"id": "c_moitie", "text": "carré de la moitié du six"}], "do": [{"id": "f_carre", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "carre_x", "at": "cue:c_pour"}, {"id": "f_bande", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "bande_6", "at": "cue:c_pour"}, {"id": "f_bande2", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "bande_3a", "at": "cue:c_pour"}, {"id": "f_bande3", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "bande_3b", "at": "cue:c_pour"}, {"id": "f_coin2", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "carre_coin", "at": "cue:c_pour"}, {"id": "f_note2", "verb": "fade_out", "target": "note_moitie", "at": "cue:c_pour"}, {"id": "h_neuf", "verb": "highlight", "target": "f4", "role": "accent", "part": "t_16", "start": "cue:c_ajoute", "end": "cue_end:c_ajoute"}]}, {"id": "b5_2", "say": "Ça donne la forme canonique, et on lit le sommet directement : S moins trois, moins seize, sur l'axe de symétrie x égale moins trois.", "cues": [{"id": "c_donne", "text": "Ça donne la forme canonique"}, {"id": "c_lit", "text": "lit le sommet"}, {"id": "c_S", "text": "S moins trois, moins seize"}, {"id": "c_axe", "text": "axe de symétrie"}], "do": [{"id": "s_idee", "verb": "show", "target": "idee", "at": "cue:c_donne"}, {"id": "h_h2", "verb": "highlight", "target": "f4", "role": "accent", "part": "t_carre", "start": "cue:c_S", "end": "cue_end:c_axe"}, {"id": "h_k2", "verb": "highlight", "target": "f4", "role": "accent", "part": "t_16", "start": "cue:c_S", "end": "cue_end:c_axe"}, {"id": "h_S2", "verb": "highlight", "target": "ptS", "role": "result", "start": "cue:c_S", "end": "cue_end:c_S"}]}]}}
